# The talking update: a bot tells /faction what just happened in the world (kind news, AutonomousChatNews).
# One block per topic. "@needs witness" lines are said only by a bot that was there; "@needs !witness" lines
# pass the news on. Each topic uses only the slots its event supplies (docs/bot-voices/TALKING-UPDATE-CONTENT.md).
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

# ---- siege_defend: {enemy} is attacking our {keep} now (keep, enemy) ----------------------------------
@kind news
@topic siege_defend
@who *
@realm *
@invites news_siege_defend
@needs witness
they are on the door at {keep}, need bodies now
{enemy} rams on the outer door at {keep}, get here
inner door at {keep} is going, anyone??
holding {keep} with like four people, we need more
oil is up at {keep} but the rams keep coming, help
@who Daredevil,NoLifer
{keep} is full of {enemy}, come get some rp
@who *
@needs !witness
{keep} under attack by {enemy}, anyone close?
heard {enemy} is hitting {keep}, defenders needed
{keep} is getting sieged, who can go?
{enemy} at {keep} again, they never leave it alone
defend {keep}! {enemy} on the doors
@who Leveler
@who *
@needs !witness,newbie
it says {keep} is under attack? is that one ours?
@needs !witness,veteran
{enemy} on {keep} again, everyone who is 40+ please go

