# ---- enemy_seen: a {size}-strong {enemy} group seen in {zone} (enemy, zone, size) ----------------------
# {zone} needs a place flag: lines that name the zone are said from RvR; a relay from elsewhere leaves it out.
@kind news
@topic enemy_seen
@who *
@realm *
@invites news_enemy_seen
@needs witness,in_rvr
inc {size} {enemy} in {zone}
{size} {enemy} just ran past me in {zone}
{enemy} group in {zone}, about {size}, careful
i see {size} {enemy} in {zone}, they are moving fast
@needs !witness,in_rvr
{size} {enemy} seen in {zone}, watch out
heard {size} {enemy} are roaming {zone}
{enemy} zerg in {zone}, {size} or so
heads up, {size} {enemy} spotted in {zone}
@needs !witness
{size} {enemy} out roaming, stay sharp
{enemy} group of {size} out there, careful
@who Daredevil
{size} {enemy}? lets go find them

# The talking update audit: only a bot at a camp is stuck at one
@kind news
@topic siege_defend
@who Leveler
@realm *
@levels 1-50
@needs !witness,at_camp
@invites news_siege_defend
{keep} getting hit if anyone cares, im stuck at my camp
